tagLiquidablePosition.tree
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert with MarketPaused
└── when market is not paused
    ├── given user position is healthy
    │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketPositionHealthy
    ├── given user position is already tagged
    │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketPositionAlreadyTagged
    └── given user position is liquidatable and not tagged
        ├── it should set liquidablePositions[user].tagger to liquidator
        ├── it should set liquidablePositions[user].timestamp to current timestamp
        └── it should emit TagLiquidablePosition event 